---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/pages/the-method.css';
---

<Layout title="The Method: Secure Prospective" description="Diagnose, Position, Shape, Transform, and Re-diagnose inside the operating business first.">
  <Nav />
  <main transition:name="page-card">
    <section class="record-hero">
      <div class="record-hero-grid shell">
        <div class="record-hero-index"><span>FILE // METHOD</span><span>CYCLE // OPEN</span></div>
        <div class="record-hero-copy">
          <h1>The method goes to work here first.</h1>
          <p>
            Diagnose, Position, Shape, and Transform are not four boxes on a consulting slide. They are
            controls applied to the business that already has to perform.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--white">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>01</strong><span>Diagnose</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>Find the constraint before the tool.</h2>
          <p>
            The IMO is metered as an operating system: people, cases, decisions, handoffs, data, delay, and
            responsibility. Symptoms do not receive software. The root constraint receives a diagnosis.
          </p>
          <div class="quote-field">A wrong diagnosis makes every correct build irrelevant.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--silver">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>02</strong><span>Position</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>Put capability where consequences are understood.</h2>
          <p>
            AI placed without context creates confidence in the wrong output. Positioning defines where a
            tool belongs, what information it may use, where a human must intervene, and what cannot be delegated.
          </p>
          <ul class="assurance-list">
            <li><span>A</span><strong>Environment</strong><p>Understand the people, process, data, and obligations surrounding the tool.</p></li>
            <li><span>B</span><strong>Boundary</strong><p>Name what the system may decide, assist, surface, or never touch.</p></li>
            <li><span>C</span><strong>Owner</strong><p>Keep a responsible person attached to every consequential output.</p></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--blue">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>03</strong><span>Shape</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>Structure output so the operation can hold it.</h2>
          <p>
            Output no one understands is output no one owns. SP+ must make work inspectable, correctable,
            and transferable. The system serves the operator. It does not become an unchallengeable black box.
          </p>
          <div class="status-strip">
            <div><span>Output</span><strong>Legible</strong></div>
            <div><span>Decision</span><strong>Traceable</strong></div>
            <div><span>Ownership</span><strong>Human-held</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--ink">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>04</strong><span>Transform</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>Change the operation, not the vocabulary.</h2>
          <p>
            AI-powered means a feature was added. AI-native means the architecture of the work changed.
            Transformation is not declared when SP+ runs. It is demonstrated when the operation works differently
            because SP+ is part of it.
          </p>
          <div class="quote-field">The deliverable must survive contact with the business.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="record-section record-section--yellow">
      <div class="record-section-grid shell">
        <aside class="record-margin"><strong>↺</strong><span>Re-diagnose</span></aside>
        <div class="record-body">
          <h2>Secure the next state.</h2>
          <p>
            Every prospective system eventually becomes part of the operating foundation. Once it does, the
            work is measured again. New constraints surface. The next cycle begins without pretending the future
            has stopped moving.
          </p>
          <a class="action action--dark" href="/the-work#sp-plus">See the active application <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<script>
  import '../scripts/motion.js';
  import '../scripts/pages/the-method.js';
</script>
